{"id":"u-5059900c-9cce-4412-a8ae-94e165015d69","src":"community","title":"Taylar’s training program 2 day workout plan","author":"Taylar G.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/NuU9aE-taylars-training-program-2-day-workout-plan","desc":"This is for people that can only go to the gym 2 days a week and need a beginner workout plan!This is upper/lower split. Ex. One day is upper and next day is lower body. \n\nThis plan doesn’t use barbells or deadlifts. No hate to them, but my gym doesn’t have them so I wanted this plan to be very beginner friendly! I personally use this plan and it’s not perfect but it works for me and if it help someone else figure out what they want, then that’s fine with me! \n\nPlease make sure you stretch and warm up your body before your sets and always listen to your body. If something doesn’t work look up other alternatives! ❤️ You got this! \n\nOvertime you should be adding more weight and reps to your exercises. Look into Progressive overload.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Women's","Bodyweight Fitness","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":9,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-06-08T18:24:20.436Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Standing Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":60,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Extension (Machine)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Reverse Lunge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Hip Adductor (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hip Abductor (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Goblet Squat","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Back Extension","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Glute Bridge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]}]}]